WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.968
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show."
You're here. You made it.

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:08.133
[ Cheers and applause ]
Gonna be fun.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.534
Well, guys, today,
nominations were announced for

00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:12.868
the 64th annual Grammy Awards.

00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:14.000
That's right.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.667
Both Billie Eilish
and her brother, Finneas,

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:17.801
were nominated.

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:20.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.968
So I just want to say good luck
to their cousins

00:00:22.968 --> 00:00:25.234
Talking about their jobs
at Thanksgiving.

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:29.367
Olivia Rodrigo's
"drivers license" was nominated.

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:32.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:34.234
That's how you know
it's been a long 2021.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:37.367
People were thinking,
"That came out this year?"

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:39.234
Yeah, the Grammys
will be on CBS,

00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:41.300
which means the only
nominee that viewers

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.334
will be familiar with is ABBA.

00:00:45.634 --> 00:00:47.934
"I know -- Yeah, I love ABBA."

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:51.934
Well, earlier tonight,

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:53.534
President Biden
and the First Lady

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:57.100
arrived in Nantucket, where
they'll spend Thanksgiving.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.968
That's how bad
Thanksgiving traffic is.

00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:02.467
Even the president
has to leave two days early.

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:04.501
Good luck to us.

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:05.968
Yeah, once Biden
left for Thanksgiving,

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:07.400
the Secret Service was like,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.734
"Human Tryptophan
is on the move."

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:13.601
When Biden asked Obama
if Martha's Vineyard

00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:16.200
would be nice for Thanksgiving,
Obama was like,

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.901
"Uh...you should
check out Nantucket."

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:20.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.634
I have a feeling Biden's
the only person who says,

00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:28.434
"I once knew a man
from Nantucket"

00:01:28.434 --> 00:01:32.501
and then tells an
actual story about that man.

00:01:32.501 --> 00:01:34.300
[ As Biden ]
He was a longshoreman.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.033
Named Gary Finster.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.467
[ Normal voice ]
But this is nice.

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:42.634
Before they left for Nantucket,
First Lady Jill Biden

00:01:42.634 --> 00:01:44.534
received The White House
Christmas tree.

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:45.567
Take a look at this.

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:48.567
[ "O Tannenbaum" playing ]
Yeah.

00:01:50.534 --> 00:01:53.767
-Look how beautiful this is.

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:57.100
It's beautiful.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:59.834
-Yeah. You know gas prices
are out of control when

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:01.267
they're sending things to
The White House

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:03.000
via horse and carriage.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.334
[ Imitates whip cracking ]
Come on!

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:08.501
Come on, buddy!
Come on there, buddy!"

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:11.934
[ Laughs ]

00:02:11.934 --> 00:02:14.434
That was amazing improvisational
skills on all of our part.

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:15.667
You were doing --
-Yeah, yeah.

00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:17.434
-"Come on, buddy."
-[ Imitates whip cracking ]

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:18.467
-"Come on, now."

00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:22.167
-[ Imitates whip cracking ]

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:24.100
Pbht!
-Oh!

00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:27.334
-Meanwhile, Trump
was hiding in the branches

00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:28.467
like a Trojan horse,

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:31.100
waiting to sneak back inside
The White House.

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:35.200
♪♪

00:02:39.467 --> 00:02:42.701
Speaking of Trump, I saw that,
over the weekend at Mar-a-Lago,

00:02:42.701 --> 00:02:44.067
he received his honorary

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:46.667
9th-degree black belt
in Tae Kwon Do.

00:02:46.667 --> 00:02:48.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:49.567
This is real.
Take a look. Here he is.

00:02:49.567 --> 00:02:51.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.601 --> 00:02:55.601
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.767 --> 00:02:59.501
-Tying that around Trump
must have been like

00:02:59.501 --> 00:03:01.300
tying a giant red bow
around a Lexus.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.701
You know?
You ever seen those commercials?

00:03:03.701 --> 00:03:04.834
It was the first time
they had to

00:03:04.834 --> 00:03:08.267
cut a few extra holes in
a Tae Kwon Do belt.

00:03:08.267 --> 00:03:09.868
Yeah, Trump
is big into martial arts.

00:03:09.868 --> 00:03:11.334
He's even starring in
the new movie

00:03:11.334 --> 00:03:13.400
"Crouching Tiger,
Hidden Tax Returns."

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.400
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:16.701 --> 00:03:18.434
[ Rimshot ]

00:03:18.434 --> 00:03:19.868
-Hey!

00:03:19.868 --> 00:03:22.434
Hey, oh!

00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:24.634
-Well, this went viral
last night.

00:03:24.634 --> 00:03:27.267
The Washington Wizards
played the Charlotte Hornets,

00:03:27.267 --> 00:03:30.834
but all anyone could talk about
was Wizards star Kyle Kuzma's

00:03:30.834 --> 00:03:32.067
pregame outfit.

00:03:32.067 --> 00:03:33.100
Watch this.

00:03:38.934 --> 00:03:40.200
Wow.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:43.868
He looks like a rejected
character from "Yo Gabba Gabba!"

00:03:46.767 --> 00:03:48.634
He looks like someone who said,
"I don't need to try it on.

00:03:48.634 --> 00:03:49.767
I'll just buy it."

00:03:49.767 --> 00:03:51.033
-Yeah.

00:03:51.901 --> 00:03:54.300
-Meanwhile, Lenny Kravitz's
scarf saw that

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.767
and was like, "Well, hello!"

00:03:56.767 --> 00:03:59.567
♪♪

00:03:59.567 --> 00:04:01.400
"Hello, there. Hi."

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.901
[ Laughs ]

00:04:02.901 --> 00:04:06.300
And, finally, I saw that a very
unique Christmas-tree display

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.467
has returned to
a mall in Canada.

00:04:08.467 --> 00:04:09.868
Some people think it's cute,

00:04:09.868 --> 00:04:11.601
while others think
it's a little creepy.

00:04:11.601 --> 00:04:12.601
Here, check it out.

00:04:23.534 --> 00:04:24.968
-Oh!

00:04:26.467 --> 00:04:28.767
-Well, now we know what the
Christmas episode of

00:04:28.767 --> 00:04:30.133
"Squid Game" will look like.

